				26,
				6
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync all element submodules to latest functional and build revisions\n\nUpdate all primary Land element submodules to align with recent architectural refactors and build pipeline updates:\n\n**Mountain:** Localize the `call!` macro within the IPC dispatcher to enforce closure hygiene and strict scope. Enhance the `proxy_cocoon` utility for error mapping and implement immediate `$acceptModelSaved` notifications to the Cocoon extension host upon UI-initiated Sky saves, ensuring `onDidSaveTextDocument` triggers correctly.\n\n**Wind:** Refresh the codegen pipeline to synchronize TypeScript service contracts with upstream VS Code changes, adding `browser.chatActionsSubmenu` and updating the `CommandCatalog` to 551 entries. Enable project references in `tsconfig.json` for incremental builds.\n\n**Output:** Expand `browserViewGroup` IPC stubs to include `updateKeybindings`, `openDevTools`, and other UI channels, aligning the compiled artifact with Sky component requirements.\n\n**Cocoon & Rest:** Regenerate build artifacts and update the bundled Rust/OXC binary to incorporate recent linting changes and ensure strict PascalCase compliance.\n\n**Impact:** These synchronizations ensure the IPC contract, build artifacts, and extension host visibility are consistent across the native backend, UI services, and extension runtime layers.",
			"SHA": "40a70b79c723df34e700eec756ae55c6aab86534"
		},
