			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-23T11:13:15Z",
			"File": [
				"⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				26,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Mountain): Sync submodule to centralize Cocoon IPC and URI sanitization\n\nUpdate the Mountain submodule to revision a430e1c4 to continue the standardization of the native backend IPC layer.\n\n**Key Changes:**\n- Introduce the `proxy_cocoon` helper in `Utilities::Proxy` to replace verbose inline `SendRequestToSideCar` logic in `CustomEditorProvider`, `StatusBarProvider`, `TestProvider`, `Authentication`, `Task`, and `FileSystem` handlers. This abstracts `ApplicationRunTime` retrieval and method string construction.\n- Consolidate URI sanitization by extracting `StripFileUriScheme` into `Utilities::Params` as `strip_file_uri`. Apply this to all `FileSystem` operations (ReadFile, WriteFile, Stat, etc.) to normalize `file://` URI variants consistently.\n\nThese changes reduce boilerplate in the extension host communication layer and ensure robust, unified path handling across the IPC surface.",
			"SHA": "6b92b99db0ac3e58b59bba147bba049ec482773e"
